            <div xml:id="m-89ab9876-1264-4388-b798-b2008b67968c">
              <lg xml:id="m-13ce9172-68ee-42c3-997f-4bba4de9050a">
                <l xml:id="m-e7e4e4aa-11eb-42cd-b511-cf4745adfb9c" facs="#m-fe17e784-2243-4fdf-859c-3323c861cd71" label="text-like">and Sunday of Lent.</l><l xml:id="m-664b0caf-2423-4db4-be9c-e8bf2324f8f6" facs="#m-ce6009a1-1ceb-4213-94cd-d147056de47f" label="ambiguous">840</l><l xml:id="m-388dd21f-da28-4310-bb9b-2f9256124a4c" facs="#m-5b1ee02f-434c-4714-9af6-77ce19c3a100" label="lyrics-like">quae di-lé-xi</l><l xml:id="m-b5baf470-0a7a-4e1f-ad92-eb371303a53b" facs="#m-622bdcb9-d8c0-4289-b5db-ef1fb521f0ee" label="ambiguous">valde:</l><l xml:id="m-9385e296-bb98-4b20-a77a-12c77c243c25" facs="#m-a5e4e643-9ed9-4ba3-ac0a-9aac98cd2e13" label="lyrics-like">et levá- bo</l><l xml:id="m-42599234-1a94-4e58-9bfd-f6278bfb8546" facs="#m-581bd58a-5b49-433e-95c1-28938bcd9aaa" label="lyrics-like">má¬ nus mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f7672ecf-2432-4cfd-80b1-f8c01a7cdb0d" facs="#m-63fa6752-b4ef-4876-8fce-208a18082633" label="lyrics-like">tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-6f2741d8-4c45-4013-892d-e8e56ac449fb" facs="#m-35ff20d3-718f-4201-8259-88a3c11c3c0c" label="lyrics-like">ad mandá¬ ta</l><l xml:id="m-0120847e-4822-43e2-a702-c8e829b31d6c" facs="#m-6b6ba545-816e-4ecc-9079-7cc77513b431" label="ambiguous">as</l><l xml:id="m-0a74fd11-6c79-4a58-9475-46d2907d22e5" facs="#m-c33acf6c-8272-4b34-a5d3-c34bf567345e" label="lyrics-like">a, quae di-lé¬</l><l xml:id="m-447dc855-bd35-4671-adf6-2c386e39bb4c" facs="#m-5d3b7b02-3398-49d5-8ae3-2006e23917c2" label="ambiguous">xI.</l><l xml:id="m-e98aef52-fc5a-4245-8788-2bcb50a749e8" facs="#m-19127be7-1ccd-4515-9e74-f8537d9f85cf" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-8196744a-880d-46ed-9d81-760d04dcab2f" facs="#m-a430383c-9f2f-4e82-b516-44101e4ef50a" label="lyrics-like">NAcrificiis praeséntibus, Dómine) ut et devotióni nostrae proficiant,</l><l xml:id="m-1806c214-d0a6-496f-89f3-a2a0c118f6d2" facs="#m-b3710eb9-41bd-40db-a60d-2294ed3f8ca1" label="lyrics-like">O quaésumus, inténde placátus : et salúti. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-0e292578-3db3-437f-b8d7-bcea00f78465" facs="#m-6bf8b930-f0d0-4e7b-83a0-3de5f084809b" label="lyrics-like">2. Exáudi nos. p. 501. — 3. Deus, cui soli. p. 529.</l><l xml:id="m-ef24d995-68ad-44ea-8658-5b91e61ca8e9" facs="#m-3ba185f8-653f-4a92-b810-16de69cd2359" label="ambiguous">comm.8</l><l xml:id="m-39840e48-5683-46b7-a43c-40ac93c14442" facs="#m-038f739e-24f7-421f-8f7e-8fd33a926789" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-6a631686-496b-4e5b-87af-b00c068b2727" facs="#m-9827173c-a792-4090-8ac2-2e637a4e578f" label="lyrics-like">um: inténde vó-ci</l><l xml:id="m-37e41cfe-c5c7-48c2-8052-5e673c1db9ac" facs="#m-2fe04ff1-c6c2-46dd-afb1-2ba021601930" label="lyrics-like"> Ntél-lige“ clamórem mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-2e9a1cf0-5a12-4d0e-b806-863d0bd86318" facs="#m-e69f55ee-04d7-49db-b857-07d83e7c2602" label="lyrics-like">ora-ti-6- nis mé-ae, Rex mé- us, et Dé- us mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-7ac1ce63-75d8-4cd8-8319-668dfc02ac63" facs="#m-f5b5c878-6ad5-4a3e-a388-61baa139b07e" label="lyrics-like">Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-d5b69fcb-96c1-4c34-adea-a971d8500cc7" facs="#m-abc4a87f-c417-40d5-847c-6f193be8d6f7" label="lyrics-like">us: quóni-am ad te orábo,</l><l xml:id="m-f564acb4-e861-4364-adc3-1929a5d42454" facs="#m-c0f62619-0546-429c-9589-4161a6226bc8" label="ambiguous">mi¬ ne.</l><l xml:id="m-fe8cd6ed-6607-4c63-be71-9f498d4b1a70" facs="#m-45df115f-998e-48bd-b813-2d3d22e6c0ef" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-36200c4d-0bfe-43f0-85fa-7eef51ac10ed" facs="#m-c9524c2a-031c-4352-823e-5a06d95a235a" label="lyrics-like">(Upplices te rogámus, omnípot-[ribus dignánter deservire concédas.</l><l xml:id="m-de437083-d09f-415b-96df-82c7216b1fdc" facs="#m-cd3ee250-fe69-40a5-aa23-9bde24658cc4" label="lyrics-like">Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9488338c-35c7-46fc-b0b9-2c64475c9733" facs="#m-7d05bcb8-c693-4899-b3b8-84d364cb16ac" label="lyrics-like">D ens Deus: ut, quos tuis réficis</l><l xml:id="m-131afc7e-40c1-4459-8c21-e8c030d518e1" facs="#m-38b0dfe3-42b7-4f84-a3ef-5118518fc4b9" label="lyrics-like">sacraméntis, tibi étiam plácitis mó¬</l><l xml:id="m-fcd7121f-61c4-4188-a2b3-0938b2ed3c85" facs="#m-2e12d953-90c7-494a-9e7d-ac24db95c83b" label="lyrics-like">2. Mundet et múniat. p. 502. — 3. Puríficent nos. p. 530.</l><l xml:id="m-cce8b628-9f86-4010-868c-81cb0d07c091" facs="#m-2860a638-3a3b-49d4-9574-b4db78e701d5" label="text-like">AT SEXT</l><l xml:id="m-f0bbe139-a1ee-4dd7-90aa-9689e81ce884" facs="#m-bfc42dd4-28bd-4b6d-b195-fa1c559702b0" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-314fc3e0-0788-435b-b702-37411db418a0" facs="#m-5cb663fb-2f74-462f-ba48-07a32d9a7a68" label="ambiguous">4.A</l><l xml:id="m-83935da2-00b1-4438-831f-ba57510704df" facs="#m-3c6ae3b8-9124-4517-8844-b6f76bf75761" label="lyrics-like">Aci-ámus hic“ tri-a tabernácula:</l><l xml:id="m-c8eece8d-dd3b-48d4-9e8e-176dd9f2d9b5" facs="#m-f64c7cf1-8979-457b-8a03-6d332a98c0ae" label="lyrics-like">tibi únum,</l><l xml:id="m-e7276c9a-827b-4197-8244-80b1346fac14" facs="#m-fbf929c4-5baf-40d0-8aa2-29942c0601eb" label="ambiguous">4</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>